    perlu apa kemari?","parentUIDs":[12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":15}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":213.399979,"yPos":121.8},"ID":14,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ini
    pak saya mau tanya. Kemarin malam bapak sempat melihat Sarip tidak ya?","parentUIDs":[13],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":16}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":214.399979,"yPos":237.800018},"ID":15,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Hhmm..
    Sepertinya kemarin saya melihat seperti seseorang kebetulan lewat bu","parentUIDs":[14],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":17}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":440.4,"yPos":239.800018},"ID":16,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Tetapi
    dia sambil berlari membawa sesuatu. Kemudian dia sempat mampir ke rumah warga","parentUIDs":[15],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":18}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":441.4,"yPos":346.799866},"ID":17,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ya
    rencana saya mau menangkap dia. Barangkali dia pencuri.","parentUIDs":[16],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":19}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":215.4,"yPos":349.799866},"ID":18,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Tapi
    saat dihampiri dia langsung kabur bu. Dan ajaibnya di depan rumah warga itu sudah
    ada makanan. Sepertinya dia ingin membagikan bahan makanan itu pada warga desa
    sini bu. ","parentUIDs":[17],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":23}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":211.4,"yPos":458.799927},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"(Hmm
    apa mungkin itu Sarip. Tapi aku tidak terlalu yakin)","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":24}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":451.400024,"yPos":457.799927},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Terima
    kasih ya pak informasinya. Semoga pelakunya bisa ditemukan.","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":448.4,"yPos":574.7999},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Baik
    bu sama-sama. Semoga Sarip cepat ketemu bu.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0}]}'
